annot(#noCore)

# The twin of `classArrow.ct` with [P]'s arrow left out: `(_ -> S) -> T..` says every member of [S]
  converts to a [T], and [P] has no arrow to one, so the page is refused at the class arrow.
#noCore
class(S)
data(T(v -> Yes))
data(P)
data(Yes)
every(T.., isa= [/S])
every(P, isa= [/S])

(_ -> S) -> T..
